### 5.3 调用示例

```csharp
public async Task<AiImageResult> EnhanceImage(string imageUrl)
{
    // 1. 下载图片
    var imageBytes = await _httpClient.GetByteArrayAsync(imageUrl);

    // 2. 调用AI服务
    var result = await _aiService.EnhanceAsync(imageBytes, new EnhanceOptions
    {
        Style = "realistic",
        Brightness = 10,
        Contrast = 5
    });

    // 3. 返回处理后的图片
    return result;
}
```

### 5.4 降级策略

```
主服务失败 → 切换到备用服务 → 备用也失败 → 返回错误，提示稍后重试
```

